 |---|---|---|---|---|---|
 | `viewer` | Yes | No (`AuthError`) | No (`AuthError`) | No (`AuthError`) | No (`AuthError`) |
 | `editor` | Yes | Yes | Yes | Yes | No (`AuthError`) |
 | `admin` | Yes | Yes | Yes | Yes | Yes |
 
